              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kasiyikubanika abafazi bamadodakazi ethu, ngoba abantwana bakoIsrayeli bafunga besithi: Uqalekisiwe onika uBhenjamini umfazi.",
          "type": "text",
