          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhekani, bhekani, lapho amadodakazi aseShilo ephuma ukugida, niphume ezivinini, nizithabathele, kube yilowo nalowo umkakhe emadodakazini aseShilo, niye ezweni lakwaBenjamini.",
          "type": "text",
