              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantwana bakwaBenjamini benza kanjalo, bazithathela abafazi ngokwenani labo kubadansi ababebathumbile; bahamba babuyela efeni labo, bakha imizi, bahlala kuyo.",
          "type": "text",
