              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantwana bakwa-Israyeli basuka lapho ngaleso sikhathi, kwaba yilowo nalowo waya esizweni sakubo nasemndenini wakhe, baphuma lapho, kwaba yilowo nalowo waya efeni lakhe.",
          "type": "text",
